# Icons where the accent is a SELECTED / ON state rather than decoration.
# These get the strong tier, because the off state they must be distinguished from
# is drawn in #949494 / #DBDBDB line art and a mid-grey would collapse into it.
# One glob per line; '#' starts a comment.

check_on.svg
check_on_focused.svg
check_half.svg
check_half_focused.svg
radio_on.svg
radio_on_hover.svg
toggle_on.svg
capsule_tag_on.svg
switch_send_mode_on.svg
switch_send_mode_tag_on.svg
video_state_on.svg
plate_locked*.svg

# one_layer_{on,off}[_hover][_dark] -- the layer slider. Loaded by IMTexture, which
# has NO recolor hook, so the baked value is final; both on and off carry accent and
# are told apart structurally (one highlighted band vs. a full outline).
one_layer_*.svg
